WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
Hello, my name is Saikriti Chhetri and I am from Darjeeling.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.600
I am an English educator in Brindavan boarding school.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.780
Okay, what do I like most about teaching is interacting with my students because I believe

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.760
teaching is a two-way process.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:24.080
It is not just like we teach them but it is like we learn from our students as well.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.480
So communicating with them, getting inspired by them, inspiring them.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:34.500
So it is a two-way process and this is what I like the most about teaching.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.880
The most important thing I want my children to learn is to be confident in day-to-day

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:47.760
life while facing the obstacles, to be confident and face the obstacles with full energy and

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:55.300
I want them to be motivated and always inspired by the teachers of Brindavan boarding school.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:03.060
The thing that makes Brindavan Boding School special is the theory of inclusive education,

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:08.540
meaning we give education to all the children despite their abilities, their backgrounds,

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.100
and the school also gives sponsorship to the students who are socially backward and who

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.480
cannot afford fees.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:21.060
So we give them like nominal fees and the school supports them a lot.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:21.560
Thank you.
